                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_standard rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_standard rendering_contributiontojournal_standard"><a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/publications/ss-03-the-end-of-the-fossil-fuel-age-discourse-politics-and-clima/" class="link"><span><strong>SS-03 'The End of the Fossil Fuel Age'? Discourse Politics and Climate Change Political Economy: Discourse politics and climate change political economy.</strong></span></a> / <a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/matthew.paterson/" class="link"><span>Paterson, Matthew</span></a>. <br />In: <span>New Political Economy</span>, Vol. 26, No. 6, 02.11.2021, p. 923-936.<p class="type"><span class="type_family">Research output<span class="type_family_sep">: </span></span><span class="type_classification_parent">Contribution to journal<span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span></span><span class="type_classification">Article</span><span class="type_classification"><span class="type_parent_sep"> › </span>peer-review</span></p></div>
